A type system with complete type inference via constraint generation and unification - automatically determines the most general (principal) type for all expressions without annotations; basis for ML,

A ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/type-system.td")} with **complete type inference** via **constraint generation** and **unification** - automatically determines the **most general (principal) type** for all expressions without annotations; basis for ML, OCaml, Haskell.
